    "title": "Rory McIlroy calls off divorce to Erica Stoll, has epic US Open collapse",
    "text": "NEWSBizarre, emotion-filled week of Rory McIlroy (divorce, US Open loss) ends with turtles at Florida beachPro golfer Rory McIlroy of Jupiter, Florida, is taking time off the PGA Tour to get his head straight after losing the US Open.John Bisognano Samantha NeelyPalm Beach PostJune 20, 2024, 9:18 a.m. ETPro golfer Rory McIlroy had one heck of a bizarre, emotion-filled week.Maybe looking at some sea turtles in Juno Beach eased his mind.The week began when, on the eve of the U.S. Open — one of golf's four major tournaments — the Jupiter resident, who last month had filed for divorce with his wife of seven years, Erica Stoll, announced that the couple had \"resolved our differences.\"",
